{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function experimental_streamedQuery<TQueryFnData, TData, TQueryKey>(options: StreamedQueryParams<TQueryFnData, TData, TQueryKey>): (context: object) => TData | Promise<TData>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/streamedQuery.ts#L70","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/query-core/src/streamedQuery.ts:70"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This is a helper function to create a query function that streams data from an AsyncIterable.\nData will be an Array of all the chunks received.\nThe query will be in a 'pending' state until the first chunk of data is received, but will go to 'success' after that.\nThe query will stay in fetchStatus 'fetching' until the stream ends."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tqueryfndata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryFnData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":"[]"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tquerykey","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryKey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" readonly "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":"[] = readonly "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":"[]"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"StreamedQueryParams"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"streamFn"},{"type":"text","value":" that returns an AsyncIterable to stream data from, and the optional\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"refetchMode"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"reducer"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"initialValue"},{"type":"text","value":" options."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A query function to pass as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryFn"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"context"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"object"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"await queryClient.query({\n  queryKey: ['data'],\n  queryFn: streamedQuery({\n    streamFn: fetchDataInChunks,\n  }),\n})","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tqueryfndata","text":"TQueryFnData","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"tquerykey","text":"TQueryKey","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction experimental_streamedQuery<TQueryFnData, TData, TQueryKey>(options: StreamedQueryParams<TQueryFnData, TData, TQueryKey>): (context: object) => TData | Promise<TData>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/streamedQuery.ts:70](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/streamedQuery.ts#L70)\n\nThis is a helper function to create a query function that streams data from an AsyncIterable.\nData will be an Array of all the chunks received.\nThe query will be in a 'pending' state until the first chunk of data is received, but will go to 'success' after that.\nThe query will stay in fetchStatus 'fetching' until the stream ends.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `TQueryFnData`[]\n\n### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* readonly `unknown`[] = readonly `unknown`[]\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`StreamedQueryParams`\\<`TQueryFnData`, `TData`, `TQueryKey`\\>\n\nThe `streamFn` that returns an AsyncIterable to stream data from, and the optional\n`refetchMode`, `reducer`, and `initialValue` options.\n\n## Returns\n\nA query function to pass as `queryFn`.\n\n(`context`: `object`) => `TData` \\| `Promise`\\<`TData`\\>\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nawait queryClient.query({\n  queryKey: ['data'],\n  queryFn: streamedQuery({\n    streamFn: fetchDataInChunks,\n  }),\n})\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: experimental_streamedQuery\ntitle: experimental_streamedQuery\nredirect_from:\n  - reference/streamedQuery\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction experimental_streamedQuery<TQueryFnData, TData, TQueryKey>(options: StreamedQueryParams<TQueryFnData, TData, TQueryKey>): (context: object) => TData | Promise<TData>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/streamedQuery.ts:70](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/streamedQuery.ts#L70)\n\nThis is a helper function to create a query function that streams data from an AsyncIterable.\nData will be an Array of all the chunks received.\nThe query will be in a 'pending' state until the first chunk of data is received, but will go to 'success' after that.\nThe query will stay in fetchStatus 'fetching' until the stream ends.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `TQueryFnData`[]\n\n### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* readonly `unknown`[] = readonly `unknown`[]\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`StreamedQueryParams`\\<`TQueryFnData`, `TData`, `TQueryKey`\\>\n\nThe `streamFn` that returns an AsyncIterable to stream data from, and the optional\n`refetchMode`, `reducer`, and `initialValue` options.\n\n## Returns\n\nA query function to pass as `queryFn`.\n\n(`context`: `object`) => `TData` \\| `Promise`\\<`TData`\\>\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nawait queryClient.query({\n  queryKey: ['data'],\n  queryFn: streamedQuery({\n    streamFn: fetchDataInChunks,\n  }),\n})\n```\n"}
